Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/E0927_unknown_marker_method.jet:4:20
    |
  4 |     fn value(self) => Int {
    |                    ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0068

Error [E0927]: `#Bogus` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/E0927_unknown_marker_method.jet:3:6
    |
  3 |     #Bogus
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: `Bogus` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: check the spelling, or see docs/spec/syntax-decisions.md for the full applied-rule list.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0927
